  "instructions": [
    "Heat the vegetable oil in a paella pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the diced Chinese ham and cook until browned.",
    "Add the sliced century eggs and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the rice and stir to combine with the ham and eggs.",
    "Add the water and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Stir in the ferment jang, sesame oil, and salt.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning as needed.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped scallions."
